     order of insertion into the _f_i_l_e___a_c_t_i_o_n_s object.  It also sets the work‐
     ing directory for the spawned program.  The
     ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnn__ffiillee__aaccttiioonnss__aaddddcchhddiirr__nnpp() function takes the _p_a_t_h to set as
     the working directory, while ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnn__ffiillee__aaccttiioonnss__aaddddffcchhddiirr__nnpp()
     takes the directory file descriptor.

